NUM-02: group inlet backflow ratios by capture node

computeBackflowRatios() reproduces 5.3.0's single model-wide bucket on
purpose, so a capture node's overflow is split across all inlets of the
model instead of the inlets that drain to it. Accumulate the open area,
link counts and custom inlet counts per capture node, in the same order as
legacy, so the ratios match the patched 5.3.0 exactly.

Apply from the root of a Stormwater-Management-Model checkout at cb3e192b:
    git apply NUM-02_swmm600.patch

